ve explicitly auxiliary blueprint entries.\n- Keep the current global-pair and projective extraction constructions distinguished from the remaining concrete transfer, arbitrary-strategy reduction, source-domain comparison and final soundness obligations. The pauli_soundness statement and its existing sorry remain unchanged.\n- Connect the final blueprint proof to the ancilla-intertwining and Alice/Bob transfer support results with explicit citations and dependency edges, addressing F1 of review 5245488540.\n- Preserve the original PR #536 audit, failed attempts and cost history.\n\n### Testing\n\n- The bounded F1 fix changes only the blueprint chapter (seven insertions, three deletions). The chapter and all 652 tracked Lean files passed the repair hash manifest; no Lean file changed relative to the previously reviewed head.\n- Blueprint web rendering, label resolution, LaTeX checks, 38 focused existing tests and normal commit hooks passed.\n- The previous head passed all nine CI contexts and the rooted axiom audit. Canonical CI and the rooted audit are being run again for the newly published fix; their exact results will replace this interim Testing note.\n- Fresh bounded F1 recheck remains required before approval. The complete independent review and its unresolved finding remain recorded on the old head.\n\n---\nAddresses #529\n", "created_at": "2026-09-18T05:54:14Z", "updated_at": "2026-09-18T10:29:13Z", "closed_at": null, "merged_at": null, "merge_commit_sha": "93c492fe6bc7bf7ef494c23c14a049ccb209e15f", "assignees": [], "requested_reviewers": [], "requested_teams": [], "labels": [{"id": 12025010884, "node_id": "LA_kwDOUJyJf88AAAACzL8axA", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/labels/formalization", "name": "formalization", "color": "ededed", "default": false, "description": "Lean formalization of a mathematical statement", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 12025012183, "node_id": "LA_kwDOUJyJf88AAAACzL8f1w", "url": "https://a